            <MudTable Items="_backups" Dense="true" Class="mt-4"><HeaderContent><MudTh>@Text["FileName"]</MudTh><MudTh>@Text["Size"]</MudTh><MudTh>@Text["Created"]</MudTh><MudTh></MudTh></HeaderContent><RowTemplate>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Text["FileName"]">@context.FileName</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Text["Size"]">@FormatBytes(context.Size)</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Text["Created"]">@Date(context.CreatedAt)</MudTd>
